    dcterms:description "Wealth segmentation. Values seen: 'Ultra HNI', 'HNI', 'Affluent', 'Retail'. These form an ordered ladder, but the ordering is a business convention - there is NO lookup table and NO numeric rank column, so any sort by tier needs an explicit CASE expression. Type-1 overwrite: a client's historical tier is NOT retained anywhere." ;
    rdfs:domain <https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/table/main/dim_client_master> ;
    meta:nullable "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    meta:sourceColumn "tier" ;
    meta:sourceSqlType "VARCHAR" .

