    dcterms:description "Market-capitalisation band (Large/Mid/Small Cap) per SEBI's ranked definition. STORED AS A SINGLE CURRENT VALUE WITH NO EFFECTIVE DATE, yet SEBI reclassifies the universe every six months. Historical style analysis using this column applies TODAY's classification to PAST holdings - a subtle but real point-in-time error the schema has no mechanism to fix. Observed values (25 rows): Large Cap (20), Mid Cap (4), Small Cap (1)." ;
    rdfs:domain <https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/table/main/dim_cmot_company_mstr> ;
