    dcterms:description "ETL load timestamp, WITHOUT TIME ZONE - no timezone is recorded anywhere, so IST vs UTC is a convention held outside the DB. Present in 12 of 14 dim_* tables; absent from both MF history tables and from all 7 client_* facts." ;
