    dcterms:description "Equity data vendor company code -> dim_cmot_company_mstr.co_code. WARNING: the same column name in dim_cmot_index_prices identifies an INDEX, not a company. Populated on 30 of 98 rows: all 25 Direct Equity products (every one matches dim_cmot_company_mstr.co_code), plus 3 REITs (1050, 1051, 1052) and 2 InvITs (1053, 1054), whose codes do NOT appear in the supplied company master. Blank for every other product type. Whether those five codes should reference dim_cmot_company_mstr (company export incomplete) or another table is not stated by the source and must be confirmed with the data team. Preserve each original co_code; leave the five unmatched - do not invent company records or guess another target." ;
    rdfs:domain <https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/table/main/dim_product_unified_cat> ;
    meta:nullable "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    meta:sourceColumn "co_code" ;
