  ranks after ''240301''. VERIFIED derivable: = current_value - invested_value. DO
  NOT parse it - COMPUTE it. Also mis-classified as a BI ''dimension'' in the schema
  documentation''s semantic layer, so tools will not offer it as a measure.'
display_name: Unrealized Gain
filterable: true
name: unrealized_gain
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
type_defect: numeric stored as varchar; compute current_value - invested_value
verified_identity: current_value - invested_value
