attribute_type_corrected: fact
description: 'TYPE DEFECT: character varying(256) while both its operands are proper
  double precision. COMPUTE inflow - outflow instead of reading it, since a text column
  sorts and compares as text. The stored text equals inflow - outflow on all 612 rows,
  with a leading minus sign on the 87 net-outflow rows; outflow is never negative.
  NNM is a headline KPI - it isolates genuine asset gathering from market movement,
  which AUM growth cannot.'
