  ''Fixed Deposits''), AGG_MUTUAL_FUNDS (180, ''Mutual Funds''). NONE of the 612 rows
  matches a dim_product_unified_cat.product_id (individual products such as PROD_EQ_001),
  so the declared join returns no rows - and an equivalent query must keep returning
  none. Read the bucket from product_type on the same row. Whether AGG_* codes denote
  investment categories is not stated by the source and must be confirmed with the
  data team. A confirmed category relationship may be added separately; it must not
  replace this join or spread a category total across individual products. Preserve
