<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/client_realized_gain/realized_gain> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: fact
description: 'VERIFIED on sample id 110001 (SBI, 130 units, 505.19 -> 799.52): (799.52
  - 505.19) * 130 = 38262.90, EXACT. So realized_gain = (sell_price - buy_price) *
  quantity, GROSS of costs - no brokerage, STT or tax is netted off. There is NO realized_loss
  column and no sign flag, so a loss must be a NEGATIVE realized_gain. SUM() therefore
  yields a NET figure; split on sign to report gross gains and losses separately.'
display_name: Realized Gain
filterable: true
