  210 match a code whose row names a DIFFERENT client_id, and 121 carry a code absent
  from this table. A code match is a source-record match, not validated client ownership
  - reproduce each query's own join condition exactly (see client_holdings.wsw_account_code).
display_name: Account Code
filterable: true
