  - any query needing both names must join that table TWICE with distinct aliases.
  Joining once and hoping is a common silent error.
display_name: Acquiring Banker ID
filterable: true
join_target: dim_employee_profile.id
name: acquiring_banker_id
nullable: true
sql_type: integer
type: integer
""" .

