<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_equity_price_latest/nav_date> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: time_dimension
description: 'THE TABLE NAME SAYS _latest BUT THE STRUCTURE SAYS HISTORY. A date column
  plus full OHLCV is the signature of a time series. The schema documentation CANNOT
  settle whether this holds one current row per instrument or full history. Run: SELECT
  co_code, COUNT(*) FROM dim_equity_price_latest GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT
  5 - the answer changes every query you write against it. Settled in this data: 25
  rows, one per co_code, all dated 2026-05-19.'
display_name: Price Date
filterable: true
name: nav_date
nullable: true
sql_type: date
type: date
""" .

