<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_segment_map/product_id> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: '-> dim_product_unified_cat.product_id. BRIDGE - a join to a fact table
  on product_id multiplies the fact rows if a product has multiple segment assignments:
  a holding worth 1,000,000 in three segments would become three rows totalling 3,000,000.
  In this data every product_id appears exactly once (25 rows, 25 products, all Direct
  Equity), so there is at most one segment match per product. Preserve all assignments
  when reproducing SQL results; do not deduplicate the bridge automatically, and do
  not infer that future exports carry only one segment per product.'
display_name: Product ID
fan_out_hazard: true
filterable: true
join_target: dim_product_unified_cat.product_id
