- Automobiles & Ancillaries
- Banking & Financial Services
- Consumer & Retail
- Defence & Aerospace
- Diversified Conglomerates
- Energy
- Healthcare & Pharma
- Information Technology
- Infrastructure & Construction
- Telecom & Media
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

